{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A party game powered by your imagination</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Erect your empire, conquer the entire solar system and establish yourself as the ultimate emperor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create Your Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash your creativity to design the ultimate empire in your vision! Every decision you make leaves a lasting legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/SA1.png?t=1744409399\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your Wish Is Our Command, Emperor...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From erecting a statue to launching the nuclear duck, use your terminal console to type or speak your command and watch as your empire executes your brilliant plan... or crashes into the moon trying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/SA2.png?t=1744409399\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Friends Play for Free!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Host a game for your friends, whom can join using a FREE client available on Steam, the App Store, and the Play Store. Play either online or offline, even both at the same time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/SA3.png?t=1744409399\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">AI Game Master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An agent designed to consider game state, create and expand lore, and narrate a fun story filled with twists along with animated actions that showcase the impact in game! It supports LLAMA and OpenAI's GPT.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/SA4.png?t=1744409399\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hallucination? More Like Imagination!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We transformed the worst part of LLM technology\u2014hallucinations\u2014into imagination! If the AI says something happened, then it did. Fiction becomes fact!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/SA6.png?t=1744409399\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You Hate AI?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So do we!  All the art, code, and music was authored by humans. We exclusively use AI technology (ANNs) for the core gameplay loop. You may choose which AI powers the agent. By default, we offer a locally-run LLAMA model.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/SA7.png?t=1744409399\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3571460?t=1744409399","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3571460?t=1744409399","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/f1609725c48283ba099377a00ef3b2f78ed69466/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744409399","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/f1609725c48283ba099377a00ef3b2f78ed69466/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744409399","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A party game powered by your imagination</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Erect your empire, conquer the entire solar system and establish yourself as the ultimate emperor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create Your Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash your creativity to design the ultimate empire in your vision! Every decision you make leaves a lasting legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/SA1.png?t=1744409399\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your Wish Is Our Command, Emperor...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From erecting a statue to launching the nuclear duck, use your terminal console to type or speak your command and watch as your empire executes your brilliant plan... or crashes into the moon trying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/SA2.png?t=1744409399\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Friends Play for Free!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Host a game for your friends, whom can join using a FREE client available on Steam, the App Store, and the Play Store. Play either online or offline, even both at the same time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/SA3.png?t=1744409399\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">AI Game Master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An agent designed to consider game state, create and expand lore, and narrate a fun story filled with twists along with animated actions that showcase the impact in game! It supports LLAMA and OpenAI's GPT.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/SA4.png?t=1744409399\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hallucination? More Like Imagination!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We transformed the worst part of LLM technology\u2014hallucinations\u2014into imagination! If the AI says something happened, then it did. Fiction becomes fact!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/SA6.png?t=1744409399\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You Hate AI?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So do we!  All the art, code, and music was authored by humans. We exclusively use AI technology (ANNs) for the core gameplay loop. You may choose which AI powers the agent. By default, we offer a locally-run LLAMA model.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/extras/SA7.png?t=1744409399\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Ezra Hradecky"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571460/e1dfd14b44fb786db1eb6e87ac10844f92a8c4c8/header.jpg?t=1744409399","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257112273,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112273/movie480.mp4?t=1744409397","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112273/movie_max.mp4?t=1744409397"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257112273/4023c52e558ef5b1283bf90424e91e006f391071/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744409397","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112273/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744409397","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112273/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744409397"}}],"name":"Space Conquest AI","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 